WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
But not anymore.

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.360
According to the Council of Europe, in 2024,

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.640
almost 50% of inmates in German prisons

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.000
were foreign nationals or migrants.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.680
In Austria, the number was 53% of the people in prisons were.

